{"uuid":"d70b31c4-5a9c-401c-96a7-2a90b7502c04","name":"Mechanical Engineer","description":{"company":"<div><body><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Who We Are</strong></b></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;'><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">At Framework, we believe the time has come for products that are designed to last. Founded in San Francisco in 2020, our mission is to remake Consumer Electronics to respect people and the planet.</span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;'><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We've started with two award-winning products, the Framework Laptop 13 and 16. Our laptops are thin, light, high-performance notebooks that can be upgraded, customized, and repaired in ways that no other notebook can. Alongside this, we've launched the Framework Marketplace to enable an ecosystem of parts and modules.</span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;'><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">In 2026, we introduced Framework Laptop 13 Pro, a ground-up redesign built for power users and developers, bringing a massive leap in battery life, a new CNC aluminum chassis, and our first Ubuntu Certified system, all while remaining repairable, upgradeable, and entirely yours. </span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;'><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We've seen a fantastic reception to Framework Laptop 13 Pro, with </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_xjxwl1zLMc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">MKBHD</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> calling it our “best build yet,\" </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JQb9eGeclQw\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Linus Tech Tips</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> declaring \"The Framework Pro 13 is peak laptop,\" and </span><a href=\"https://gizmodo.com/framework-laptop-13-pro-review-the-best-modular-laptop-ever-made-2000791804\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Gizmodo</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> naming it \"The Best Modular Laptop Ever Made.\" That builds on years of recognition from outlets like </span><a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/gadgets/2021/07/frameworks-new-lightweight-modular-laptop-delivers-on-its-promises/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ars Technica</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> and multiple </span><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/wirecutter/reviews/framework-laptop/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wirecutter</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> reviews (including a recommendation among the best </span><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/wirecutter/reviews/the-best-windows-ultrabook/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Windows Ultrabooks of 2024</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">), along with making </span><a href=\"https://time.com/collection/best-inventions-2021/6112625/framework-laptop/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">TIME's Best Inventions lists in 2021</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> and </span><a href=\"https://time.com/collection/best-inventions-2023/6323599/framework-laptop-16/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">2023</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">. We're incredibly proud to be recognized as #5 on</span><a href=\"https://www.fastcompany.com/91497095/consumer-electronics-most-innovative-companies-2026\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Fast Company's Most Innovative Companies of 2026</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">, proof of our growth since first appearing on the list at #35 on </span><a href=\"https://www.fastcompany.com/90722815/framework-innovative-laptop-easy-repair-electronics\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Fast Company's Most Innovative Companies of 2022</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;'><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We come from successful consumer electronics startups including the founding team of Oculus, and have closed multiple rounds of funding to fuel our roadmap. Even better (and maybe unusually for an early stage startup), we're in a financially healthy position going forward off of our product revenue. We care deeply about building a diverse and inclusive team, and we hope you do too!</span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p></body></div>","role":"<div><body><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Position</strong></b></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We are looking for a Mechanical Engineer based in Taiwan to join our fantastic engineering team to maintain the current and shape the future of Framework products.  We are specifically looking for a mechanical engineer who has out-of-the-box design thinking and spirit of taking on design challenges and problem solving ability. The engineer in this role will need to think creatively about form factor, repairability, and manufacturability in ways that are not obvious. That is the challenge, and it’s the opportunity. As a key engineering member in Taiwan, you'll work closely with our designers and engineers, with a high level of influence on our product development. Depending on alignment with requisite scope, this role may be brought on as a Mechanical Engineer or Senior Mechanical Engineer. We’ll align the scope and title to the right candidate!</span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This role is a full-time hybrid role based in Taiwan, working up to a few days per week in our office in XinYi Dist in Taipei, along with up to 10% local and international travel to partners and our US headquarters.</span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What You'll Do</strong></b></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Own the end-to-end mechanical design of modules, from initial ideation through prototyping, on not only the module level but also system level from initial ideation through prototyping, NPI, documentation, and into production.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Design parts and assemblies across 3D CAD and 2D drawings (3D printed prototyping).</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Manage and oversee the ODMs and external partners on both our new and sustaining products, driving incremental improvements in quality and durability.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Closely collaborate with our designers and engineers across both Taiwan and the US on novel product development.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Partner with our design team to develop, mock up, and test prototypes to explore new product concepts and solve design challenges as they emerge.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Manage DFM, NPI builds, and DOEs with our manufacturing partners</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Work with our quality team to solve the issue from the factory and customers.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Proactively track and experiment with new technologies, processes, and suppliers to improve our products.</span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What You Need</strong></b></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">10+ years of experience in mechanical engineering for complex electronics products.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bachelor's degree in Mechanical Engineering or equivalent experience.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A background in driving the mechanical development of a product from initial concept through production.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A strong skill set in mechanical design in CAD, including tolerance analysis, FMEA, and other simulation.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Experience with plastic injection molding, metal injection molding, die casting, forming, extrusion, high volume CNC, and other mass production processes.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Expertise designing parts, assemblies, and enclosures in plastics and metals, and bringing up tooling, managing final assembly, and running reliability testing around them.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ability to collaborate and communicate effectively with other engineers and program managers.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Strong written and verbal English communication abilities and familiarity with working across time-zones.</span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What's Nice to Have</strong></b></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A passion for environmentalism and/or DIY.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Expertise on design for 3D printing</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Previous work spanning multiple electronics product categories inside or outside of personal computing.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Expertise with mechanical engineering and product design in a startup.</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Experience working as a remote member of an international team.</span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.25pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What You'll Love</strong></b></p><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Competitive salary, equity, and health benefits</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Paid company holidays plus 20 PTO days per year</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Paid Parental Leave</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Annual Health Checks</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Flexible work hours and locations, including every other Monday off!</span></li><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The chance to work at a startup that is making a positive social and environmental impact.</span></li></ul><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Equal Opportunity</strong></b></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:11pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We are also committed to providing reasonable accommodations for all qualified individuals with disabilities. If you require an accommodation to participate in the application or interview process, please let us know by reaching out to accommodations@frame.work.</span></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><br></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Additional Notes</strong></b></p><p style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;'><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Please be aware that we only post jobs directly on our career site, LinkedIn, ZipRecruiter, Monster, Talent.com, MyJobHelper, Adzuna, Jora, and Jooble. We do not use Indeed. For the safest experience, please apply directly on our </span><a href=\"https://ats.rippling.com/framework/jobs\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">career site</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">. We also follow a rigorous hiring process, meaning we do not extend offers without multiple rounds of live interviews. Most importantly, we do not issue checks to candidates and will never ask for personal financial information, such as bank details or credit card numbers, during the interview and offer process. We manage onboarding through our HRIS platform and provide all necessary equipment directly to our employees. All official communications during the interview process only come from @ats.rippling.com and @frame.work. If you receive a suspicious message, email, or job offer, please do not click on any links and report this incident to us at </span><a href=\"mailto:hiring-team@frame.work\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"css-173makr-linkStyle\" style=\"color:rgb(30,74,169);cursor:pointer;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">hiring-team@frame.work</span></a><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">. </span></p></body></div>"},"workLocations":["Taiwan"],"department":{"name":"Mechanical Engineering","base_department":"Engineering","department_tree":["Engineering","Mechanical Engineering"]},"employmentType":{"label":"SALARIED_FT","id":"Salaried, full-time"},"createdOn":"2026-09-17T14:30:07.613000-07:00","activeJobApplication":{"additionalQuestions":[{"form":{"questions":[{"uniqueKey":"bf17827a-cab4-4078-a0a1-cde9e3d75d4b","title":"Why do you want to work at Framework?","description":"","tags":[],"dataType":"Text","questionType":"LONG_ANSWER","isRequired":true,"allowComments":false,"canEdit":false,"isPrivate":false,"strChoices":[],"intChoices":[],"isMultiSelectEnabled":false,"isOtherEnabled":false}],"deletedQuestions":[],"sections":[],"deletedSections":[],"skipLogic":[]},"name":"Default question","id":"6aaca6f7786ee7b4ec501c1a"},{"form":{"questions":[{"uniqueKey":"f399a1ec-8d2e-4383-9ccc-e1890fbb1c6c","title":"What are you looking for in your next role?","description":"","tags":[],"dataType":"enum","questionType":"SINGLE_SELECT_RADIO","isRequired":true,"allowComments":true,"canEdit":false,"isPrivate":false,"strChoices":["Technical growth and new challenges","Stability","Mission-driven work that I believe in","Leadership and influence on product decision"],"intChoices":[],"isMultiSelectEnabled":false,"isOtherEnabled":false}],"deletedQuestions":[],"sections":[],"deletedSections":[],"skipLogic":[]},"name":"SR.ME","id":"6aaca6f7786ee7b4ec501c1b"}],"basicQuestions":[{"oid":"first_name","fieldType":"SHORT_ANSWER","title":"First name","required":true},{"oid":"last_name","fieldType":"SHORT_ANSWER","title":"Last name","required":true},{"oid":"email","fieldType":"SHORT_ANSWER","title":"Email","required":true},{"oid":"pronouns","fieldType":"PRONOUN","title":"Pronouns","required":false},{"oid":"current_company","fieldType":"SHORT_ANSWER","title":"Current company","required":false},{"oid":"phone_number","fieldType":"PHONE_NUMBER","title":"Phone number","required":true},{"oid":"location","fieldType":"SHORT_ANSWER","title":"Location (city only)","required":true},{"oid":"linkedin_link","fieldType":"SHORT_ANSWER","title":"LinkedIn link","required":false},{"oid":"website_link","fieldType":"SHORT_ANSWER","title":"Website link","required":false},{"oid":"resume","fieldType":"FILE","title":"Resume","required":true},{"oid":"cover_letter","fieldType":"FILE","title":"Cover letter","required":false}]},"eeocQuestionnaireEnabled":false,"eeocQuestionnaireEnabledForJobPost":false,"url":"https://ats.rippling.com/framework/jobs/d70b31c4-5a9c-401c-96a7-2a90b7502c04","board":{"boardType":"RIPPLING","slug":"framework","logo":{"name":"lockup_black (1).png","url":"https://prod-images.rippling.com/e02d41d21a88a968f1b66c24f5b9e7ecd9d098aa.png?Expires=1789932914&Signature=VUsOhCCX1mi9212VJ5ghG~qeR~K6FpI3eo9BI12V2ZIK-ApF3Q7EpyLsthIRrbx2KZW8Hf-3h0n6IinpjyS--gK~SEavbAHaDmxcpV3gxtWwd1jd2x9rOp0k0gWwM0e~IPpoTidDPZ-ZBv~X-Sg9MN-XDfN6QaDNL4A1gpwwi0Lu07Q-OWiMjP2qE34pTUCJVIz73MvN7NQ570ogcrDq2nuNTkNZ6pjUkBHWwsN-iXIXJyWr4C3Q9RFq1BdZkqh2Cu6of9Jgy~mjLPGTjzQtyGML~hAkVIEkohQZhNLkjXwYjnBrui~rR-5dsewFkfQNc22d4g7xAkPinSvEQVXW7A__&Key-Pair-Id=K2Y26R2ZPP26PH","type":"image/png"},"banner":{"name":"","url":null,"type":""},"title":"Careers at Framework","subtitle":"Come join us to remake Consumer Electronics!","boardURL":"https://ats.rippling.com/framework/jobs","fontType":"ARIAL_SANS_SERIF","linkColor":"#567676","buttonColor":"#ff7447","buttonTextColor":null,"legalNotice":"","noOpeningsMessage":null,"groupJobsByLocation":false,"showBoardLogoOnJobPost":false,"showCompanyInfoUnderJobPost":false,"companyName":"Framework "},"payRangeDetails":[],"applicationConfirmationTemplate":"673fbf81ae0eabea63410652","hasAIEvaluationsEnabled":true,"companyName":"Framework ","unlistedFromSearch":false,"jsonLd":null}